WEBVTT

00:01:29.243 --> 00:01:30.373
blurry vision,

00:01:30.373 --> 00:01:31.674
balance problems,

00:01:31.674 --> 00:01:33.482
altered mood and behavior,

00:01:33.482 --> 00:01:36.055
problems with memory, 
thinking, and sleeping,

00:01:36.055 --> 00:01:40.383
and the onset of anxiety and depression.

00:01:40.383 --> 00:01:41.599
Every brain is different,

00:01:41.599 --> 00:01:46.514
which explains why people's experiences
of concussions vary so widely.

00:01:46.514 --> 00:01:49.794
Luckily, the majority of concussions
fully heal

00:01:49.794 --> 00:01:54.578
and symptoms disappear
within a matter of days or weeks.

00:01:54.578 --> 00:01:57.553
Lots of rest and a gradual return
to activity

00:01:57.553 --> 00:02:00.824
allows the brain to heal itself.